<title>USA: CCC seeks 3,000 tonnes U.S. sunoil for Mozambique.</title>
<headline>CCC seeks 3,000 tonnes U.S. sunoil for Mozambique.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Commodity Credit Corp of the U.S. Department of Agriculture said it was tendering on May 7 for 3,000 tonnes of U.S. crude sunflowerseed oil for export to Mozambique, June 1-20 shipment.</p>
<p>((Nigel Hunt 312-408 8720))</p>
</text>
